ait-native public source license scope

The default license for this public monorepo is the Apache License, Version
2.0 (`Apache-2.0`). It applies to the root release controls and documentation
and to the complete `ait-core/**`, `ait-runner/**`, `ait-python/**`, and
`ait-node/**` subtrees unless a file identifies incorporated third-party
material under its own terms.

The sole component exception is `ait-server/**`. That complete subtree is
licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License, Version 3 only
(`AGPL-3.0-only`), as stated by `ait-server/LICENSE`.

Bundling these separately licensed components does not relicense either one.
No commercial or proprietary license applies to a public 1.0 source path.
Complete component notices remain in each subtree. The full Apache-2.0 terms
for the default grant follow.
